        "Ensure reliability, quality and safety of energy flow through efficient networks and information system. Select reputed suppliers and components complying with CIEG norms.",
        "Innovative solutions tuned to customer needs while restricting total project cost and adopting energy saving methods. Evaluate planning schedule to complete project within target date.",
